// title: Visualise the outdated Operating Systems used to connect to your cloud environment · Defender XDR
// date: 2026-10-21
// product: Defender for Cloud Apps
// tables: CloudAppEvents
// purpose: Visualise the outdated Operating Systems used to connect to your cloud environment · Defender XDR
// source: https://github.com/Bert-JanP/Hunting-Queries-Detection-Rules/blob/65d11700e1cb878403d87312acdd6b9a8dd622c1/Defender%20For%20Cloud%20Apps/Visualization%20-%20OutdatedOSUsed.md
